{
 "duration": 27.64,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Ben wore jeans on a cool fall hike.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 2.341
  },
  {
   "text": "A light drizzle soaked them, and the cotton stayed cold and heavy for hours.",
   "start": 2.541,
   "end": 6.842
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's what to wear hiking instead.",
   "start": 7.192,
   "end": 8.974
  },
  {
   "text": "Pick pants made of quick-drying synthetic fabric like nylon, with some stretch for big steps.",
   "start": 9.274,
   "end": 14.864
  },
  {
   "text": "Leggings work on dry days, convertible pants when it warms up. Skip cotton.",
   "start": 15.064,
   "end": 19.797
  },
  {
   "text": "Now Ben's pants shed the drizzle and dry while he walks.",
   "start": 20.197,
   "end": 23.324
  },
  {
   "text": "For real rain, add a rain shell.",
   "start": 23.524,
   "end": 25.353
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next hike.",
   "start": 25.753,
   "end": 27.44
  }
 ],
